      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pixel Candle Timer</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #121019;\n      --card-bg: #1e1a29;\n      --card-border: #3b3552;\n      --text-main: #f5f2eb;\n      --text-muted: #9f98b3;\n      --accent-flame: #ffb703;\n      --flame-bright: #fff3b0;\n      --wax-body: #dfcfbe;\n      --wax-shadow: #b39f8a;\n      --wick-color: #2b262d;\n      --btn-bg: #2d263d;\n      --btn-hover: #3d3453;\n      --btn-active: #4d4269;\n      --btn-border: #5a4f78;\n      --focus-ring: #ffb703;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 24px;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card-bg);\n      border: 3px solid var(--card-border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 32px 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    /* Pixel Art Candle Scene */\n    .stage {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 160px;\n      height: 220px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      image-rendering: pixelated;\n    }\n\n    /* Flame element */\n    .flame-wrapper {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 24px;\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 36px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;\n    }\n\n    .flame-wrapper.lit {\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n\n    .flame-wrapper.unlit {\n      opacity: 0;\n    }\n\n    .flame {\n      width: 14px;\n      height: 24px;\n      background: var(--flame-bright);\n      border-radius: 50% 50% 30% 30%;\n      box-shadow:\n        0 0 0 4px var(--accent-flame),\n        0 0 18px 4px rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.6);\n      animation: flicker 0.15s infinite alternate steps(2);\n    }\n\n    @keyframes flicker {\n      0% {\n        transform: scale(1) translateY(0);\n      }\n      100% {\n        transform: scale(0.9, 1.1) translateY(-2px);\n      }\n    }\n\n    /* Wick */\n    .wick {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 14px;\n      background-color: var(--wick-color);\n      border-radius: 2px;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    /* Candle Body Container */\n    .candle-track {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 68px;\n      height: 140px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .candle-body {\n      width: 68px;\n      height: 140px;\n      background-color: var(--wax-body);\n      border: 4px solid #1a1721;\n      border-bottom: none;\n      box-shadow: inset -10px 0 0 0 var(--wax-shadow);\n      position: relative;\n      transition: height 0.25s linear;\n    }\n\n    /* Dripping wax detail */\n    .candle-body::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 6px;\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 14px;\n      background-color: var(--wax-shadow);\n    }\n\n    /* Candle base holder */\n    .candle-base {\n      width: 110px;\n      height: 14px;\n      background: #463d59;\n      border: 3px solid #1a1721;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      margin-top: -3px;\n      z-index: 3;\n    }\n\n    /* Timer & Status */\n    .timer-display {\n      font-size: 2.25rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      min-height: 48px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .status-text {\n      font-size: 1.125rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #ffb703;\n      min-height: 28px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    /* Controls */\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 16px;\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    button {\n      flex: 1;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      padding: 12px 18px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      background-color: var(--btn-bg);\n      border: 2px solid var(--btn-border);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.05s ease;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    button:hover:not(:disabled) {\n      background-color: var(--btn-hover);\n      border-color: #8172a6;\n    }\n\n    button:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    button:active:not(:disabled) {\n      background-color: var(--btn-active);\n      transform: translateY(2px);\n    }\n\n    button:disabled {\n      opacity: 0.45;\n      cursor: not-allowed;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Candle</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"stage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div id=\"flame\" class=\"flame-wrapper unlit\">\n        <div class=\"flame\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"wick\" class=\"wick\"></div>\n      <div class=\"candle-track\">\n        <div id=\"candle-body\" class=\"candle-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"candle-base\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"timer\" class=\"timer-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">3:00</div>\n    <div id=\"status\" class=\"status-text\" hidden aria-live=\"assertive\">Burnt out</div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"light-btn\" type=\"button\">Light</button>\n      <button id=\"blow-btn\" type=\"button\" disabled>Blow out</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      const TOTAL_SECONDS = 180; // 3 minutes\n      const INITIAL_BODY_HEIGHT = 140;\n      const MIN_BODY_HEIGHT = 10;\n\n      let remainingSeconds = TOTAL_SECONDS;\n      let timerInterval = null;\n      let isBurning = false;\n\n      const timerEl = document.getElementById(\"timer\");\n      const statusEl = document.getElementById(\"status\");\n      const flameEl = document.getElementById(\"flame\");\n      const wickEl = document.getElementById(\"wick\");\n      const candleBodyEl = document.getElementById(\"candle-body\");\n      const lightBtn = document.getElementById(\"light-btn\");\n      const blowBtn = document.getElementById(\"blow-btn\");\n\n      function formatTime(totalSec) {\n        const m = Math.floor(totalSec / 60);\n        const s = totalSec % 60;\n        return `${m}:${s < 10 ? \"0\" : \"\"}${s}`;\n      }\n\n      function updateVisuals() {\n        // Format display as m:ss\n        timerEl.textContent = formatTime(remainingSeconds);\n\n        // Calculate shrink ratio\n        const progress = remainingSeconds / TOTAL_SECONDS;\n        const currentHeight = MIN_BODY_HEIGHT + progress * (INITIAL_BODY_HEIGHT - MIN_BODY_HEIGHT);\n        candleBodyEl.style.height = `${currentHeight}px`;\n\n        // Adjust wick and flame position along with shrinking candle\n        const topOffset = INITIAL_BODY_HEIGHT - currentHeight + 24;\n        wickEl.style.bottom = `${currentHeight + 14}px`;\n        flameEl.style.bottom = `${currentHeight + 24}px`;\n        flameEl.style.top = \"auto\";\n      }\n\n      function tick() {\n        if (remainingSeconds > 0) {\n          remainingSeconds -= 1;\n          updateVisuals();\n        }\n\n        if (remainingSeconds <= 0) {\n          stopTimer();\n          flameEl.classList.remove(\"lit\");\n          flameEl.classList.add(\"unlit\");\n          statusEl.hidden = false;\n          lightBtn.disabled = true;\n          blowBtn.disabled = true;\n        }\n      }\n\n      function startTimer() {\n        if (remainingSeconds <= 0 || isBurning) return;\n        isBurning = true;\n        flameEl.classList.remove(\"unlit\");\n        flameEl.classList.add(\"lit\");\n        statusEl.hidden = true;\n        lightBtn.disabled = true;\n        blowBtn.disabled = false;\n        timerInterval = setInterval(tick, 1000);\n      }\n\n      function stopTimer() {\n        isBurning = false;\n        if (timerInterval) {\n          clearInterval(timerInterval);\n          timerInterval = null;\n        }\n        flameEl.classList.remove(\"lit\");\n        flameEl.classList.add(\"unlit\");\n        if (remainingSeconds > 0) {\n          lightBtn.disabled = false;\n          blowBtn.disabled = true;\n        }\n      }\n\n      lightBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", startTimer);\n      blowBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", stopTimer);\n\n      // Initial setup\n      updateVisuals();\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Single-page HTML document containing the pixel candle timer markup, accessible controls, status displays, CSS styling, and JavaScript logic."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Candle Timer\n\nA retro pixel-art candle countdown timer built using plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Designed to work completely offline in any modern browser without external assets or dependencies.\n\n## Features\n\n- **3-Minute Duration**: Accurate countdown timer beginning at 3:00 (`m:ss`).\n- **Visual Shrink**: The candle's body progressively shrinks in height as time elapses.\n- **Pixel Flame**: Animated flickering pixel flame when burning.\n- **Light & Blow out Controls**:\n  - **Light**: Ignites the candle and resumes/starts the timer.\n  - **Blow out**: Extinguishes the flame and pauses the countdown.\n- **Burnt Out State**: Extinguishes the candle and displays `Burnt out` upon reaching zero.\n- **Keyboard & Screen-Reader Accessible**: Accessible button controls with clear focus rings and `aria-live` announcements.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nOpen `index.html` directly in any web browser. No installation, build process, or server is required.\n",
      "description": "Project documentation explaining how to run and use the Pixel Candle Timer offline web application."
    }
  ]
